{"id": "33920", "title": "勾引美人", "author": "艾佟", "category": "文学名著", "count": 45, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33920.htm", "intro": "这男人疯了！初见面竟要她帮他生孩子？ 那种吃力不讨好的事情，她才不干咧！ 谁知他竟厚颜得送自个养眼照片当宣传， 再来个电话疲劳轰炸，现竟趁她出差时—— 差人送幅限制级巨画给她，且主角还是…… 为了能与他划清界线，答应他的条件—— 在应家祖宅待三天，可这三天奇迹发生了， 也许她可考虑与他交往，至於生孩子—— 哈，再说吧！ 在情场爱得风骚的常胜军遇上她却倒栽葱 还好有未来小姨子，才得以将她手到擒来， 原以为苦尽甘来，从此可甜蜜过日子， 但却在跟未来小姨子谈“交易”时—— 当场被“捉包”，没办法，只好使美男计—— 呃……她在做啥？脱衣服？！ 他本是想诱妻，可却反被妻诱， 最受不了这种诱惑，这……先小人后君子了……", "base": "files/article/html/33/33920", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2156686.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2156687.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2156688.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2156689.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2156690.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2156691.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2156692.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2156693.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2156694.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2156695.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2156696.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2156697.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2156698.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2156699.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2156700.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2156701.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2156702.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2156703.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2156704.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2156705.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2156706.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2156707.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2156708.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页